[00:09.99]Why will the police have a difficult time? | 为什么警察的日子不好过？
[00:15.28]The Greenwood Boys are a group of pop singers. | “绿林少年”是一个流行歌曲演唱团。
[00:19.38]At present, they are visiting all parts of the country. | 目前他们正在全国各地巡回演出。
[00:24.48]They will be arriving here tomorrow. | 明天就要到达此地。
[00:27.76]They will be coming by train and most of the young people in the town will be meeting them at the station. | 他们将乘火车来，镇上的大部分青年人将到车站迎接他们。
[00:35.81]Tomorrow evening they will be singing at the Workers' Club. | 明晚他们将在工人俱乐部演唱。
[00:40.82]The Greenwood Boys will be staying for five days. | “绿林少年”准备在此逗留5天。
[00:45.24]During this time, they will give five performances. | 在此期间他们将演出5场。
[00:50.16]As usual, the police will have a difficult time. | 同往常一样，警察的日子将不好过。
[00:54.70]They will be trying to keep order. | 他们将设法维持秩序。
[00:57.56]It is always the same on these occasions. | 逢这种场合，情况总是这样。
